👏 Roanoke athlete, @caleighponn_vball named the Life Ring Foundation as the recipient of a $1,000 Community Grant through Gatorade Player of the Year Program!

🏐 Caleigh was this year’s Gatorade Virginia Volleyball Player of the Year which earned her the power to award this grant to a social impact partner that helps the next generation of athletes reap the benefits of sport. 

🎗️ Together, we now have the chance to win an additional $10,000 for Fighting Kids Cancer through the Spotlight Grant! This grant can help kids battling pediatric cancer and blood disorders stay close to home, close to their teams, and continue staying involved in sports during the fight of their lives 💪

